  "later": "Other hardware targets, deeper decode fusion, release packaging and an API stability promise.",
  "limitations": [
    "Behind llama.cpp in every measured cell: decode up to 5x slower, first token up to 100x slower. Holds up to 2x the GPU memory of llama.cpp at inference.",
    "The benchmark grid is two machines and six models, with llama.cpp as the reference.",
    "There is no compatibility guarantee: APIs and formats change without notice.",
    "Benchmark cells that fail the noise contract are marked unverified and never counted."
